AutoFAB Robot Hardware: licensing

This repository is multi-licensed. Full texts are in LICENSES/.

1. Hardware designs authored by AutoFAB (everything under cad/ except
   cad/elrobot/, and everything under hardware/ except the third-party
   copies listed below) are licensed under CERN-OHL-P-2.0
   (LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt).
2. Documentation (README.md, docs/, bom/, firmware/*.md, images/) is licensed
   under CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

Third-party material (keeps its original licence):
- hardware/arm/follower/, hardware/cameras/, hardware/controller/, and
  cad/elrobot/: unmodified files from ElRobot by NormaCore,
  https://github.com/norma-core/norma-core/tree/main/hardware/elrobot,
  licensed Apache-2.0 (licence text in each of those folders and
  LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). Copied from commit
  0d17bb300d712eeb5437d41ddb95ce380b5384e6. The norma-core repository
  root is MIT; the hardware/elrobot folder carries its own Apache-2.0
  licence. Follower parts only; leader files were not copied.
- hardware/rail/: unmodified files from leslider by Pham Tuan Binh,
  https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh/leslider, licensed Apache-2.0
  (hardware/rail/LICENSE and LICENSES/third-party/leslider-Apache-2.0.txt).
  Copied from commit a7c5c86669f7452e60e764f14ab0bff406213e3d.

